# Wiki Bridge

Before any task in this project:

1. Read ~/wiki/index.md
2. Identify the relevant context:
   - Local Arch work → ~/wiki/contexts/local.md
   - Homelab work → ~/wiki/contexts/homelab.md
   - VPS work → ~/wiki/contexts/vps-quasar.md
3. Read ~/wiki/projects/sickos-league/index.md and linked files for project context
4. Read linked files from ~/wiki/system/ and ~/wiki/patterns/ as needed
5. Read ~/wiki/rules/ when writing prose for humans

During the task:
- Follow every rule with `status: active`
- Skip files with `status: deprecated`
- Flag files with `status: draft` for review before acting on them
- Flag conflicts between rules before writing code or config

After the task:
- Update ~/wiki/projects/sickos-league/ (decisions.md, deploy.md, known-issues.md, apis.md)
- Update any ~/wiki/system/ file touched by the change
- If you created a new pattern, write an atomic note with `status: draft` in the correct folder
- Update ~/wiki/index.md if you created a new file
- If unsure where a note belongs, append to ~/wiki/system/scratch.md
